      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6e3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6e1",
          "text": "A defective product can cause life-changing injuries, such as traumatic brain damage, severe burns, spinal cord injuries and broken bones. As the victim of a defective product in Colorado, you may be entitled to financial compensation for many of your related losses, including:",
          "marks": []
        }
