      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6ek",
          "text": "The value of your case will depend on factors such as your injury severity and the amount of insurance coverage available to pay a settlement. An attorney at Dormer Harpring can help you accurately evaluate your product liability case and negotiate for maximum compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6eo",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6en",
          "text": "Speak to a Thornton, Colorado Product Liability Attorney Today",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6er",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6ep",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring is passionate about holding manufacturers and other parties responsible for the injuries caused by their defective and poorly designed products. If a manufacturing company failed to take due care in the creation or safety-testing of a product – resulting in consumer injuries and deaths – we believe that victims should not have to pay for their related losses.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
